            N("Keep Garry's Mod's texture detail at its highest. Lower detail changes the textures Remix recognizes, and replacements stop matching."),
            N("Watch Committed in Task Manager > Performance > Memory: the memory in use, and the limit. When the two are close, close other programs.") },
        { "h", N("Reading memory in the game"), id = "readings" },
        { "p", N("Console: rtx_vram_stats prints how much VRAM the game uses, by category.") },
        { "p", N("The RTX package records garrysmod\\data\\native-loader\\vram.csv and vram.previous.csv every 30 seconds. nativeloader_vram_telemetry 0 stops it, and 1 starts it again. After three failed readings it stops for the map; switch it off and on to retry. These files stay on your computer.") },
        { "p", N("The loader also records native-loader\\logs\\memory.csv: the game's RAM and the system's commit, every 10 seconds."), when = "r6" },
        { "h", N("After a crash"), id = "crash" },
        { "steps",
            N("Before you start the game again, copy status.json, session.json and both vram CSV files from garrysmod\\data\\native-loader\\, and copy the rtx-remix\\logs\\ folder. The next start replaces the two JSON files and Remix's logs."),
            { N("At the next start the loader keeps a copy of the last session's logs, crash dumps and memory history in native-loader\\logs\\sessions\\, for the last five sessions and at most 200 MB. Copy that folder before newer sessions replace it; if none was kept, copy crashes\\ and native-loader\\logs\\gpu\\ yourself."), when = "r6" },
            { N("This loader keeps no copies of earlier sessions: also copy the matching dumps from crashes\\ before you restart, and update bin\\win64\\winmm.dll to loader 0.11.0 or later."), when = "legacy" },
            N("To report the crash, send those files, copies of rtx.conf, dxvk.conf and user.conf from the Garry's Mod folder, and garrysmod\\console.log if you have it."),
            N("Say which map, characters and mods you used, what you did just before, the time and time zone, the frame rate and the Committed reading."),
            N("For a GPU hang, also send the Display or nvlddmkm events from Event Viewer > Windows Logs > System, and any matching dump in C:\\Windows\\LiveKernelReports\\WATCHDOG. Dumps can hold some of the game's memory: check what you share.") },
        { "p", N("If you are asked for a GPU crash dump: change diagnostics.gpu_crash_dumps from \"off\" to \"next_start\" in the complete example above, and restart. The value stays \"next_start\"; to ask for another diagnostic start, delete native-loader\\remix\\gpu-crash-dumps.used. Diagnostics slow the game a little."), when = "r6" },
    } },
    { id = "troubleshooting", title = N("Troubleshooting"), icon = "icon16/wrench.png", items = {
